Package: mustelus
Title: Chondrichthyan Fisheries Biology
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Alastair", "Harry", , "alastair.harry@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for analysing the life history of chondrichthyan fishes
    (sharks, rays and chimaeras), covering length-weight relationships,
    length or age at maturity and maternity, fecundity, clasper
    elongation, and von Bertalanffy growth.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://alharry.github.io/mustelus/, https://github.com/alharry/mustelus
BugReports: https://github.com/alharry/mustelus/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
